      "investments": "Investments show how idle fund balances are allocated to low-risk instruments like money market funds or treasury bills.",
      "currencyPreferences": "Currency preferences configure which currency a circle uses for contributions and how payouts are handled in multi-currency scenarios.",
      "auditReports": "Audit reports are generated compliance documents summarizing financial activity for auditors and regulators."
    },
    "relationships": [
      "Each Fund belongs to one Circle and aggregates all its financial data",
      "Transactions belong to a Fund and record every financial movement",
